{"title":"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Sale prices at the Ajax Outlet Store are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f7f4de02215a8c5319886c13b2e291811346e1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> below original prices.  On Saturdays an additional discount of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> off the sale price is given.  What is the Saturday price of a coat whose original price is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/8/748575c2510c94a8251f8435ed7aed4a7b42aee5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/8/8a8efa340dcc0d94b5900ffdfa4ba3201c1c3c77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\$54 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\$72 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\$90 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\$108 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\$110$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"442\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sale price of the coat is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/d/6ed807f81f33d0356de59e26f2e4403338d41a33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1-0.5)(\\$180) = (0.5)(\\$180) = \\$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"285\" height=\"20\" />.  The Saturday price is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/d/c5d6d2cbe2604ddd150eaaa1d78d4d7bcdcd6cd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1-0.2)(\\$90) = (0.8)(\\$90) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\$72}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"312\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After applying both discounts to an item, its price would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/8/ec8904befac599107455b50b16da184648326d84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1-0.5)(1-0.2) = 0.5 \\cdot 0.8 = 0.4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"271\" height=\"20\" /> times its original price.  Therefore, the Saturday price of the coat is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/b/b7b7a15550077232d8b6b848f9e9065dc23221c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.4 \\cdot \\$180 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\$72}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"171\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME\" title=\"1986 AJHSME\">1986 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1986\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">